{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get neighbours"},"description":"Every series to walk to from one series, as the dependency map on the site draws it: stored links with their direction and evidence (the stored basis), other measures of the same concept, the same measure at a neighbouring place or for the whole country, and other measures at the same place. With familyTable it also returns the family table its site page shows: every member's latest value, unit and change, and, where the family compares with Polska, the gap to Polska and the place. Call it again on a neighbour to walk on. Navigation hints, not proof of a cause.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"familyTable":{"description":"Also return the family table the series' page shows: each member's latest value, unit and change, and the gap to Polska and the place where the family compares with Polska. It reads up to about a hundred series, so it is off by default.","type":"boolean"},"id":{"description":"Public series id: a slug or <dataset>/<dimension>=<code>.","maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"At most this many neighbours, in the map's order; default every one.","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"relations":{"description":"Only these relations; default every one. variant: another measure of the same concept; family: the same measure one step away (a neighbouring place, the whole country, another group); place: another measure at the same place; the rest are stored links.","items":{"enum":["part_of","derived_from","chain","affects","pair","worth_seeing","variant","family","place"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":9,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"slug":{"description":"Series id, e.g. \"inflacja-cpi\" (from podziemie_search_series).","pattern":"^[a-z0-9-]{1,80}$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"podziem